cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the manuscript below. It is in preparation
  and not yet published, so cite it as such; this file will be updated with the
  journal reference and DOI once it is accepted.
title: KmerFormer
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch k-mer transformer for short-read metagenomic taxonomic
  classification, with a systematic comparison against genomic foundation models
  under documented training data, label space and evaluation conditions.
  Pre-training provides a low-data advantage, while tokenization and reference
  distance change the relative performance of the tested classifiers.
